  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently defaults to ldp:contains, but needs to respect specified predicates in config.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Logic for adding this feature:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "--------------------------------------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Read list of predicates from config file. When walking Fedora repository and finding children of a particular node, get the objects of all triples with the specified predicates and add them to the list of nodes to be walked.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When determining the location of a given resource (whether Fedora or local), the tool should compare the path against the repository base rather than to the full repository path (-r flag in conifiguration) since not all resources will be under the root node in terms of ldp containment when user supplied predicates are used.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
